cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Sigelith Cosigner"
abstract: >-
  Independent cosigner (witness) for the Sigelith public timestamp log. Every minute
  it fetches the public log, checks the hash chain and the time of every new entry
  against its own clock, recomputes the RFC 9162 Merkle tree itself and signs what it
  saw (sigelith-cosign-v1). It has no inbound interface: it pulls the log and pushes
  its signature back, so nobody can send it anything to sign.
authors:
